    "body": "<del>Good thing we're being sticklers about this test thing... https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/4988 reveals that in fact it seems the entry setting object gets set to the entry settings object while this algorithm runs, not the entry settings object of the node document in which the function originates.</del>\r\n\r\n<del>Still going to try to wrangle some incumbent tests in, but in the meantime, I'll update the spec patch here to do the right thing for entry...</del>\r\n\r\n<ins>Nevermind, I was testing the wrong thing</ins>",
